PROVENANCE
----------

Authored in full by NearMidnightNow. This plugin is the standalone SKSE port of
the author's own Community Shaders features - cs-footprints, cs-snowblanket,
cs-snowcollision and cs-snowbuildup - and contains no code from Community
Shaders itself or from any other project.


